)(x-1)+\\frac{{f}^{″}(1)}{2!}(x-1)^{2}+\\frac{{f}^{‴}(1)}{3!}(x-1)^{3} \\\\  & \\,+\\frac{{f}^{(4)}(1)}{4!}(x-1)^{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we need to work out $f(1),$ ${f}^{′}(1),$ ${f}^{″}(1),$ ${f}^{‴}(1)$ and ${f}^{(4)}(1),$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}}=2{x}^{-2} & ⟹ &  & f(1) & =2 \\\\ {f}^{′}(x) & =-4{x}^{-3} & ⟹ &  & {f}^{′}(1) & =-4 \\\\ {f}^{″}(x) & =12{x}^{-4} & ⟹ &  & {f}^{″}(1) & =12 \\\\ {f}^{‴}(x) & =-48{x}^{-5} & ⟹ &  & {f}^{‴}(1) & =-48 \\\\ {f}^{(4)}(x) & =240{x}^{-6} & ⟹ &  & {f}^{(4)}(1) & =240\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${P}_{4}(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{4}(x) & =2-4(x-1)+\\frac{12}{2!}(x-1)^{2}-\\frac{48}{3!}(x-1)^{3}+\\frac{240}{4!}(x-1)^{4} \\\\  & =2-4(x-1)+6(x-1)^{2}-8(x-1)^{3}+10(x-1)^{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535194 true] [17592186336833 1000 #edb/ref 17592186336834 13194139535194 true] [17592186336833 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535194 true] [17592186336833 1041 "field-1" 13194139535194 true] [17592186336833 1104 #edb/ref 17592186336834 13194139535194 true] [17592186336833 1110 #uuid "f9d0a568-d305-56e6-9d1d-b79ca1758e57" 13194139535194 true] [17592186336834 1034 "4" 13194139535194 true] [17592186336834 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535194 true] [17592186336834 1111 #uuid "5b8e0cb3-006f-50f9-a2af-07598735d819" 13194139535194 true] [17592186336835 1000 #edb/ref 17592186336836 13194139535194 true] [17592186336835 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535194 true] [17592186336835 1041 "field-2" 13194139535194 true] [17592186336835 1104 #edb/ref 17592186336836 13194139535194 true] [17592186336835 1110 #uuid "2b79111f-9961-55ff-a4e6-9f59810654a2" 13194139535194 true] [17592186336836 1034 "6" 13194139535194 true] [17592186336836 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535194 true] [17592186336836 1111 #uuid "e0bcf312-fdc9-5712-83ba-9ffe50962a2f" 13194139535194 true] [17592186336837 1000 #edb/ref 17592186336838 13194139535194 true] [17592186336837 1040 #edb/ref 175921860